{"chunk_id": "3c07d98b-737f-4c9b-98cc-c2b7023012a3", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "# JVM 垃圾回收\n\nJVM 问题常见切入点是：Java 进程启动后内存对象如何分布？对象什么时候被回收？常见垃圾回收算法和垃圾回收器有哪些？\n\n![jvm-memory](./assets/jvm-memory.png)\n\n![gc-roots](./assets/gc-roots.png)", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 4}, "char_len": 148}
