{"chunk_id": "5fb142ee-f80e-4006-9022-01bd66359b76", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "## 一、JVM 运行时内存\n\nJVM 运行时数据区通常包括堆、方法区、虚拟机栈、本地方法栈、程序计数器。堆是对象主要分配区域，线程共享。虚拟机栈是线程私有的，保存栈帧、局部变量表、操作数栈等。\n\n面试时不要把“堆和栈”说成操作系统概念混在一起，要说明 Java 对象多数在堆中，局部变量引用在栈帧中。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 一、JVM 运行时内存", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 151}
{"chunk_id": "ac0c141f-0c92-4fe2-97e2-cbd60bb12076", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "JVM 运行时数据区通常包括堆、方法区、虚拟机栈、本地方法栈、程序计数器。堆是对象主要分配区域，线程共享。虚拟机栈是线程私有的，保存栈帧、局部变量表、操作数栈等。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "5fb142ee-f80e-4006-9022-01bd66359b76", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 一、JVM 运行时内存", "metadata": {"block_id": "2b3f57f9-efc6-4d07-a05d-baeaba360202"}, "char_len": 81}
{"chunk_id": "c3cbe5e1-76ec-44e9-ad87-d885978115af", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "面试时不要把“堆和栈”说成操作系统概念混在一起，要说明 Java 对象多数在堆中，局部变量引用在栈帧中。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "5fb142ee-f80e-4006-9022-01bd66359b76", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 一、JVM 运行时内存", "metadata": {"block_id": "d3600a3d-5a92-4a91-86a8-07a5073f8cf9"}, "char_len": 52}
{"chunk_id": "95a08674-0b81-44b2-8045-1326d429961e", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "## 二、如何判断对象是否可回收\n\n常见判断方式有引用计数和可达性分析。JVM 主流使用可达性分析，从 GC Roots 出发，如果对象不可达，就可能被回收。\n\nGC Roots 包括：\n- 虚拟机栈中的引用；\n- 方法区中的静态变量引用；\n- 常量引用；\n- JNI 引用；\n- 被 synchronized 持有的对象等。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 二、如何判断对象是否可回收", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 163}
{"chunk_id": "fbf08e96-3d32-4af7-8a76-a214fc386458", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "常见判断方式有引用计数和可达性分析。JVM 主流使用可达性分析，从 GC Roots 出发，如果对象不可达，就可能被回收。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "95a08674-0b81-44b2-8045-1326d429961e", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 二、如何判断对象是否可回收", "metadata": {"block_id": "43116cb5-02c1-4688-87c9-3516a49bc4a3"}, "char_len": 61}
{"chunk_id": "65e3e8c6-ac37-4d15-a0a7-e9f4b914da48", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "GC Roots 包括：\n- 虚拟机栈中的引用；\n- 方法区中的静态变量引用；\n- 常量引用；\n- JNI 引用；\n- 被 synchronized 持有的对象等。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "95a08674-0b81-44b2-8045-1326d429961e", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 二、如何判断对象是否可回收", "metadata": {"block_id": "9d7e86ae-7923-48c6-a624-e76a21e1b719"}, "char_len": 82}
{"chunk_id": "7a1ac2d9-f04c-4f9f-8fcc-899f69091ad4", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "## 三、垃圾回收算法\n\n常见算法包括标记-清除、复制、标记-整理、分代收集。\n\n新生代对象朝生夕死，适合复制算法；老年代对象存活时间长，通常更适合标记-清除或标记-整理。分代收集基于对象生命周期差异，分别采用不同策略。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 三、垃圾回收算法", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 110}
{"chunk_id": "85c0eb16-41f6-47d3-a7fc-1f681d888de4", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "常见算法包括标记-清除、复制、标记-整理、分代收集。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "7a1ac2d9-f04c-4f9f-8fcc-899f69091ad4", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 三、垃圾回收算法", "metadata": {"block_id": "fb15b7f2-250f-487a-a004-d80fb76ee079"}, "char_len": 26}
{"chunk_id": "2fb41a54-99bc-4aed-8851-bce8f3680640", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "新生代对象朝生夕死，适合复制算法；老年代对象存活时间长，通常更适合标记-清除或标记-整理。分代收集基于对象生命周期差异，分别采用不同策略。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "7a1ac2d9-f04c-4f9f-8fcc-899f69091ad4", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 三、垃圾回收算法", "metadata": {"block_id": "6d14b2f8-b014-4b81-a9d0-ae25495c4432"}, "char_len": 69}
{"chunk_id": "aebea681-d8a1-4992-9602-e95b6e72e230", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "## 四、常见垃圾回收器\n\n常见回收器包括 Serial、ParNew、Parallel Scavenge、CMS、G1、ZGC、Shenandoah 等。现在服务端常见选择可能是 G1 或 ZGC，具体取决于 JDK 版本、延迟目标、吞吐需求。\n\nG1 把堆划分成多个 Region，可以做可预测停顿。ZGC 更强调低延迟，适合大堆和低停顿场景。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 四、常见垃圾回收器", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 174}
{"chunk_id": "ce1ba7af-6d62-432a-a15c-3e50194365dd", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "常见回收器包括 Serial、ParNew、Parallel Scavenge、CMS、G1、ZGC、Shenandoah 等。现在服务端常见选择可能是 G1 或 ZGC，具体取决于 JDK 版本、延迟目标、吞吐需求。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "aebea681-d8a1-4992-9602-e95b6e72e230", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 四、常见垃圾回收器", "metadata": {"block_id": "e57d15ea-1f32-49a1-b22d-a11b526c4242"}, "char_len": 109}
{"chunk_id": "c0a112b2-9e1c-4693-a144-0904b085a205", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "G1 把堆划分成多个 Region，可以做可预测停顿。ZGC 更强调低延迟，适合大堆和低停顿场景。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "aebea681-d8a1-4992-9602-e95b6e72e230", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 四、常见垃圾回收器", "metadata": {"block_id": "7115fe8b-659e-4ee3-b5a4-201cff52f9df"}, "char_len": 49}
{"chunk_id": "3d51cb00-089a-4c49-a6c4-783df15a3735", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "## 五、内存泄漏和内存溢出\n\n内存泄漏是对象不再需要却仍然被引用，导致无法回收。内存溢出是内存不够用了，比如堆空间不足抛出 OOM。泄漏时间长了可能导致溢出。\n\n常见场景：\n- 静态集合持有对象；\n- ThreadLocal 没有 remove；\n- 连接、文件句柄未释放；\n- 缓存没有淘汰策略。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 五、内存泄漏和内存溢出", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 150}
{"chunk_id": "d6006cfc-10a2-4633-95b1-ff8b77eb2345", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "内存泄漏是对象不再需要却仍然被引用，导致无法回收。内存溢出是内存不够用了，比如堆空间不足抛出 OOM。泄漏时间长了可能导致溢出。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "3d51cb00-089a-4c49-a6c4-783df15a3735", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 五、内存泄漏和内存溢出", "metadata": {"block_id": "b140741c-f661-492b-a89f-39905c0afd73"}, "char_len": 64}
{"chunk_id": "39395a35-124a-4295-8f77-fee84104c038", "doc_id": "xiaolin_004_jvm_gc", "text": "常见场景：\n- 静态集合持有对象；\n- ThreadLocal 没有 remove；\n- 连接、文件句柄未释放；\n- 缓存没有淘汰策略。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "3d51cb00-089a-4c49-a6c4-783df15a3735", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "JVM 垃圾回收 > 五、内存泄漏和内存溢出", "metadata": {"block_id": "1d47b02f-8aea-453a-9e22-a237076004f8"}, "char_len": 68}
